id=fold-display
name=DeX Display Control
version=v2.8.0
versionCode=280
author=Ilkygul
description=Resolution and refresh rate for USB-C monitors on Samsung DeX, remembered per monitor, with DeX and apps kept at the monitor's rate. Optional: keep the phone screen off while connected, a lower phone screen refresh rate during DeX, and experimental compression (DSC) and extra refresh rates (for example 5120x2160 at 110 Hz). Open the page from KernelSU Manager. Root required.
